  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "generate Courage Sphere buffing nearby allies; damage threshold triggers heal for all in-range allies",
    "skill1": "create arena in center; buff all allies when own side controls it",
    "skill2": "heal self and two weakest allies with DEF boost",
    "skill3": "battle ATK increase",
    "skill4": "Courage Sphere enhances over time, dealing continuous DoT to enemies adjacent to in-range allies",
    "skill5": "aura duration frozen when own side controls arena"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Mikola]] generates a **Courage Sphere** that buffs nearby allies and **heals everyone in range** once damage thresholds trip during the fight. She places a **central zone** that empowers allies while her side controls it, and heals two weakest allies with DEF boosts to keep fragile carries standing. The sphere grows over time, dealing **continuous DoT to enemies** adjacent to buffed allies, and zone control **freezes aura duration** so the buff window does not decay early. She needs **map control and grouped allies** inside Courage range to maximize healing, DoT aura, and zone bonuses. Fights that **deny zone ownership** or keep allies scattered shrink her buff and sustain impact.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Mikola]]'s PVP threat is the **Courage Sphere** that follows her, buffing and healing allies in range once damage thresholds trip, plus a **central Honor Arena** that freezes aura duration while her side holds it. **Shove sphere receivers off the aura** with targeted displacement from [[Lumont]] or [[Pippa]], then deny arena ownership. **Delete her early** with [[filter:assassin-delete]] like [[Ravion]] or [[Himmel]] before the sphere matures, or lock ally healing with [[filter:heal-inhibitor]] like [[Dunlingr]]'s Curelock while [[Ravion]] or [[Himmel]] pressures her."
}
